{"data": {"event": {"id": "9aa350d9-aa41-4ab9-a9ce-23884e1d212f", "picture": null, "sessionType": "S\u00e9ance p\u00e9dagogique", "sessionTypeColor": "#44bdfa", "voting": null, "title": "Actualit\u00e9s des affaires professionnelles en radiologie", "start": "2026-10-09T15:15+02:00", "end": "2026-10-09T16:45+02:00", "objectives": ["<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">\u00c0 l\u2019issue de cette session, les participants seront capables de :</p>", "<ol data-spread=\"true\" start=\"1\">", "\t<li><strong>Actualiser leurs connaissances sur les \u00e9volutions r\u00e9glementaires, \u00e9conomiques et organisationnelles de la radiologie</strong>, notamment la d\u00e9mographie m\u00e9dicale, la CCAM, le PLFSS et les autorisations d\u2019activit\u00e9 en radiologie interventionnelle.</li>", "\t<li><strong>Identifier les d\u00e9marches permettant d\u2019am\u00e9liorer la qualit\u00e9 et la pertinence des pratiques en imagerie</strong>, notamment \u00e0 travers l\u2019audit par les pairs, les recommandations de pertinence et les initiatives professionnelles.</li>", "\t<li><strong>Analyser les \u00e9volutions r\u00e9centes et leurs impacts sur l\u2019exercice de la radiologie</strong>, notamment dans les domaines de l\u2019intelligence artificielle, de l\u2019organisation professionnelle et du d\u00e9pistage du cancer du sein.</li>", "</ol>"], "onAir": null, "vod": {"checkPermissions": ["media:view"], "media": null}, "broadcasts": {"items": []}, "room": {"id": "628607c6-3f4e-46f9-9bdf-24778538e3f3", "name": "Amphith\u00e9\u00e2tre Bordeaux", "type": "ROOM"}, "schedule": {"items": [{"id": "a3f61ded-20ff-4795-84e1-e43dacfcc956", "title": "D\u00e9mographie m\u00e9dicale: bilan actuel", "start": "2026-10-09T15:15+02:00", "end": "2026-10-09T15:25+02:00", "element": {"abstract": null}, "speakers": {"items": [{"id": "7549a043-0a28-403c-ba64-3cb411218ad3", "lastName": "Boyer", "firstName": "Louis", "roles": [{"name": "speaker"}], "photo": {"url": "https://services.y-congress.com/congress/wspre